Date: Tue, 30 Jun 2026 02:01:27 -0500
Subject: [PATCH 01/42] fix: migrate old step names to canonical 14-step naming
 + fix template-draft type error

- service-case-step-context: fixed PREVIOUS_STEP, STEP_LABELS, step handler maps
- closing-evidence-routing: merged ses_filing/ses_approval -> step_11_ses
- document-ingestion: added missing step_07_evidence, merged duplicate step_11_ses
- notification.service: added legacy aliases for backward compat
- service-case.service: added legacy aliases for backward compat
- template-draft: filter extended roles to canonical 8 for TemplatePermission type
- document.service, order-closure: step name migration
- closing-evidence-routing tests: updated for canonical step names
- domain/src/index.ts: sorted exports consistently (lint fix)
- Gates: typecheck 0 errors, tests 653/653
